Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:16.65,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}あきらめちゃっていいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:20.61,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}やめちゃえって思うのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:23.95,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}逃げ出すことさえできなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.62,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}フラフラ、フラフラ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:31.41,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信が無くてそのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:35.37,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自分自身も出せなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:38.84,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信無くしてスパイラル
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:42.55,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}グルグル、グルグル
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:48.89,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}でも出逢えたから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:55.73,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}もう見失わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:58.48,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑顔があれば、
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.15,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.23,0:23:01.98,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}豪華な品も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:03.78,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}派手な飾りも、
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.90,0:23:05.49,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:07.53,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}食卓囲もう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:09.32,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}昨日のミスも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:11.16,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}不安な明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:12.33,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.83,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}ねぇ、いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.71,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}凝った味付けも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.58,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}シャレた盛り付けも、
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:20.29,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:22.30,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}涙の味はも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.09,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}しょっぱいとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:26.09,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}最後にいつも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:29.47,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:32.76,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}それがスパイス
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.35,0:22:16.65,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明放棄比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.27,0:22:20.61,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明想著不要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.78,0:22:23.95,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是卻連逃開也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.70,0:22:27.62,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}搖搖晃晃  搖搖晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.12,0:22:31.41,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:35.37,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不會好好表達自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.54,0:22:38.84,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在丟失了自信的螺旋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:42.55,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一圈一圈  一圈一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:48.89,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是已經相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:55.73,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不會再弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:58.48,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要有了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.52,0:23:00.15,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.23,0:23:01.98,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華的餐品也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.07,0:23:03.78,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}華麗的裝飾也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.90,0:23:05.49,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:07.53,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}餐桌上已經
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:09.32,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}昨天的錯誤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:11.16,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不安的明天也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:12.33,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}全部擺上了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.83,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}呐  多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.00,0:23:16.71,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}凝固的調料也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.83,0:23:18.58,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}精美的裝盤也好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:20.29,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:22.30,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}眼淚的味道已經
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.34,0:23:24.09,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}就算變得鹹鹹的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:26.09,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最後也會一直
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.13,0:23:29.47,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.68,0:23:32.76,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這就是調味品
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.17,0:24:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
